add lower boiler band.\n  - Mug: add latte art top.\n  - Glass carafe: okay.\n  - Bread: add crumbs, butter dish, jam jar? perhaps a small pat of butter on a blue plate. This adds coziness. Place left of bread at x=540? no space with soap. Maybe put small butter crock right of bread? Between bread and lemons only 30px. Could place on board at x=735. A little crock with butter and knife. But knife already. Maybe not.\n  - Add a honey jar / jam jar on a small plate near toast? Could add near right side.\n  - Lemons: improve bowl shape and add highlights.\n  - Add a striped linen napkin hanging from counter edge at left maybe. Hmm.\nD. Shelves:\n  - Add hand-painted details to plates and bowls, more shading. Add under-shelf shadows (currently shadow is tiny); a stronger broad shadow behind.\n  - Add brackets with brass? okay.\n  - Add a second trailing plant? fine.\n  - Add a few small hooks and copper measuring spoons.\nE. Window:\n  - Add stronger sun in sky and bloom.\n  - Make curtains more translucent and ends glowing.\n  - Add light spill at bottom.\n  - Add tiny plant leaf shadows on sill? maybe.\nF. Cat:\n  - Improve facial proportions and body shape: current head too large / no neck? Maybe add cheek fluff, closed eye smiles, body fur shading, a little white bib.\n  - Add ear rim light.\n  - Cushion striped; add tassels.\nG. Cabinets:\n  - Add more depth, different handle style, subtle shadow and vertical grain. Add a tea towel on a brass rail below sink to fill blank.\n  - Add two lower doors under sink perhaps with beadboard and a towel bar. Better: a curtain under sink? no.\n  - Add brass cup pulls instead of knobs? Knobs are fine. Maybe long brass pulls for drawers.\n  - Add warm reflected glow near floor.\n\nH. Floor:\n  - Add rug fringe at top? At bottom? Rug starts at 956 and bottom cropped, fringe can show at bottom if y=1090; currently crop. Add tassels from bottom edge at 1085 maybe. Since image cuts at 1100, fringe visible.\n  - Improve slippers: mak