wall. Here the right wall is same plane as window, so no. Beams should show. The sunbeams could be more visible, but we have. Maybe a few streaks across the counter and cat. In the graded version, there are subtle diagonal bands in the upper right and around. Good.\n\nCould add a couple of dust motes larger with bokeh effect. Already.\n\nThe image is 1600x1100; final 3200x2200. Good.\n\nNeed maybe add a second warmth by lighting the tea towel etc.\n\nLet's fix coffee ground cup? Moka pot handle shape now good.\n\nPotential issue: French press plunger top is at y~600, near shelf; okay. It might be mistaken for a French press, yes.\n\nPotential issue: The lemon bowl and plates stacked (the bowl has a white plate? It looks like a bowl with lemons and another white bowl in front; actually there is a stacked plate on the counter in front of the bowl? Let's inspect. In image, bowl of lemons at 840, but the path of bowl maybe looks like a stack of white plates because the bowl rim is offset; there's an extra white bowl under the lemons? I see a white dish under lemon bowl, likely okay. Wait the lemon bowl path starts at y=687 and bottom y=726; but the shadow and bowl look like plate. Fine.\n\nCat's cushion is red / pink. Good.\n\nThe left window frame starts at x=92, but curtain rod extends beyond; good. The window is cut? no.\n\nTop border: wall at top, no ceiling. Fine.\n\nImage aspect 1.45:1. Might be better as 16:9? User likely no constraints. We could deliver 1600x1100.\n\nMaybe add a small title text \"morning\" somewhere? User asked draw, no text. Avoid.\n\nCould add a mug on a saucer, a loaf of bread, good.\n\nNeed maybe add a warm cup of coffee with steam visibly rising. Steam currently faint. In graded version, steam not obvious. Increase steam opacity and add more curls. This is key for \"morning\". Moka pot steam visible as faint. French press steam. Mug. Let's strengthen but not cartoonish:\n- steam paths stroke width 5, opacity 0.55, blur 1.5, warm white. Maybe add 2 more visible curling wisps.\n- In image, steam from moka and mug is hardly seen. Add an obvious wisp above moka, with 0.5 opacity and thin line; it can stand out.\n- Add sunlit steam near window? nice.\n\nAlso add a \"fresh bread\" steam? no.\n\nLet's increase steam:\n- Moka: three paths opacity .55/.4/.3 with blur 1.5.\n- Mug: paths .45.\n- French press: .4.\n- Add a wisp above the bowl of lemons? no.\nCould add steam near bread? no.\n\nLet's edit specific opacity/width. We can search for `<!-- steam -->` three groups. Use edit."}
