1051 438 1057 C438 1065 446 1069 455 1066 C459 1064 458 1057 456 1051 C454 1044 451 1037 446 1036 Z\" fill=\"#8f6b4c\"/> // opening at heel\n<path d=\"M438 1037 C430 1045 426 1051 426 1056\" ... cuff>\n```\nBut current outer has toe pointing left and heel right. Opening should be at right. We can modify:\n- Remove `path d=\"M414 1035 ...\" fill #aa8562` and the next #c09b75.\n- Add heel opening path at x=438..457.\n- Add toe cap line separating front.\n- Add a fluffy cuff at heel border.\n- Add a strap across? Hmm.\n- For right slipper similarly.\n\nLet's do targeted edit of those inner paths and add details. Read slipper section."}
